* sg13g2-lc-pll :: sim/divider-elab -- divider SPEED check, A-codes (issue #61). M = 12, A = 0 (N = 96) and A = 3 (N = 102),
* real chain (cml2cmos + counters) fed by an ideal 0.4 Vpp differential sine at 3.18 V common mode, at 625 and 687.5 MHz.
* Nominal corner (hbt_typ, mos_tt, cap_typ), 27 C, 3.3 V. Separate deck from divider_speed: the bias op does not converge with all eight instances in one deck.
.lib @@MODELS_DIR@@/cornerHBT.lib hbt_typ
.lib @@MODELS_DIR@@/cornerMOShv.lib mos_tt
.lib @@MODELS_DIR@@/cornerCAP.lib cap_typ
.option temp=27
.include @@DIV_NETLIST@@
VDD vdd 0 3.3
V1 one 0 dc 3.3
IRF vdd iref dc 50u
XQR iref iref rr 0 npn13G2v Nx=1 El=1
RR rr 0 2400
VP1 inp1 0 dc 3.18 sin(3.18 0.2 625meg)
VN1 inn1 0 dc 3.18 sin(3.18 -0.2 625meg)
VP2 inp2 0 dc 3.18 sin(3.18 0.2 687.5meg)
VN2 inn2 0 dc 3.18 sin(3.18 -0.2 687.5meg)
Xa0r625 inp1 inn1 iref 0 0 one one 0 0 0 mca1 fba1 vdd 0 divider
Xa0r687 inp2 inn2 iref 0 0 one one 0 0 0 mca2 fba2 vdd 0 divider
Xa7r625 inp1 inn1 iref 0 0 one one one one one mcb1 fbb1 vdd 0 divider
Xa7r687 inp2 inn2 iref 0 0 one one one one one mcb2 fbb2 vdd 0 divider
.save v(xa0r625.ck) v(mca1) v(fba1) v(xa0r687.ck) v(mca2) v(fba2) v(xa7r625.ck) v(mcb1) v(fbb1) v(xa7r687.ck) v(mcb2) v(fbb2)
.control
pre_osdi @@OSDI_PSP@@
pre_osdi @@OSDI_PSP_NQS@@
op
tran 20p 150n 0 20p
wrdata @@OUT_DIR@@/speedA.data v(xa0r625.ck) v(mca1) v(fba1) v(xa0r687.ck) v(mca2) v(fba2) v(xa7r625.ck) v(mcb1) v(fbb1) v(xa7r687.ck) v(mcb2) v(fbb2)
.endc
.end
